    {
      "id": "poem-04a0371b5a46408b",
      "title": "欹松漪",
      "author": "顾况",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "湛湛碧涟漪，老松欹侧卧。",
        "悠扬绿萝影，下拂波纹破。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-04d504a40f020683",
      "title": "嫦娥",
      "author": "李商隐",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "云母屏风烛影深，长河渐落晓星沉。",
        "嫦娥应悔偷灵药，碧海青天夜夜心。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-063c772f3a515b92",
      "title": "晚次鄂州",
      "author": "卢纶",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "云开远见洛阳城，犹见孤帆一日程。",
        "估客昼眠知浪静，舟人夜语觉潮生。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-07877fd95c4ae8d4",
      "title": "宿建德江",
      "author": "孟浩然",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "移舟泊烟渚，日暮客愁新。",
        "野旷天低树，江清月近人。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-07b93b61434d7c91",
      "title": "江南曲",
      "author": "李益",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "嫁得瞿塘贾，朝朝误妾期。",
        "早知潮有信，嫁与弄潮儿。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-0c1030849fc318fc",
      "title": "过山农家",
      "author": "顾况",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "板桥人渡泉声，茅檐日午鸡鸣。",
        "莫嗔焙茶烟暗，却喜晒谷天晴。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-0d1aee3c06711aac",
      "title": "江畔独步寻花",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "黄四娘家花满蹊，千朵万朵压枝低。",
        "留连戏蝶时时舞，自在娇莺恰恰啼。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-0e003f36bc9b206a",
      "title": "岁暮归南山",
      "author": "孟浩然",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "北阙休上书，南山归敝庐。",
        "不才明主弃，多病故人疏。",
        "白发催年老，青阳逼岁除。",
        "永怀愁不寐，松月夜窗虚。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-0e610e94be7436da",
      "title": "绝句三首",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "前年渝州杀刺史，今年开州杀刺吏。",
        "群盗相随剧虎狼，食人更肯留妻子。",
        "二十一人同入蜀。",
        "惟残一人出骆谷。",
        "自说二女啮臂时，回头却向秦云器。",
        "殿前兵马虽骁雄，纵暴略与羌浑同。",
        "闻道杀人汉水上，妇女多在官军中。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-11617005a460dee2",
      "title": "白雪歌送武判官归京",
      "author": "岑参",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "北风卷地白草折，胡天八月即飞雪。",
        "忽如一夜春风来，千树万树梨花开。",
        "散入珠帘湿罗幕，狐裘不暖锦衾薄。",
        "将军角弓不得控，都护铁衣冷难著。",
        "瀚海阑干百丈冰，愁云惨淡万里凝。",
        "中军置酒饮归客，胡琴琵琶与羌笛。",
        "纷纷暮雪下辕门，风掣红旗冻不翻。",
        "轮台东门送君去，去时雪满天山路。",
        "山回路转不见君，雪上空留马行处。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-132e41b424ff75cd",
      "title": "望洞庭",
      "author": "刘禹锡",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "湖光秋月两相和，潭面无风镜未磨。",
        "遥望洞庭山水翠，白银盘里一青螺。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-17640317128c50cb",
      "title": "夜上受降城闻笛",
      "author": "李益",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "回乐烽前沙似雪，受降城外月如霜。",
        "不知何处吹芦管，一夜征人尽望乡。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-1b023b9b56bec96d",
      "title": "寄李儋元锡",
      "author": "韦应物",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "去年花里逢君别，今日花开又一年。",
        "世事茫茫难自料，春愁黯黯独成眠。",
        "身多疾病思田里，邑有流亡愧俸钱。",
        "闻道欲来相问讯，西楼望月几回圆。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-1c59b51fc790e0cf",
      "title": "竹枝词",
      "author": "刘禹锡",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "杨柳青青江水平，闻郎江上唱歌声。",
        "东边日出西边雨，道是无晴还有晴。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-1d8d421f2cb173c8",
      "title": "夕次盱眙县",
      "author": "韦应物",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "落帆逗淮镇，停舫临孤驿。",
        "浩浩风起波，冥冥日沉夕。",
        "人归山郭暗，雁下芦洲白。",
        "独夜忆秦关，听钟未眠客。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-1e38592f8f4f3c85",
      "title": "次北固山下",
      "author": "王湾",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "客路青山外，行舟绿水前。",
        "潮平两岸阔，风正一帆悬。",
        "海日生残夜，江春入旧年。",
        "乡书何处达？归雁洛阳边。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-1f405a9878373e2a",
      "title": "行军九日思长安故园",
      "author": "岑参",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "强欲登高去，无人送酒来。",
        "遥怜故园菊，应傍战场开。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-20a51f4c05853f3d",
      "title": "登楼",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "花近高楼伤客心，万方多难此登临。",
        "锦江春色来天地，玉垒浮云变古今。",
        "北极朝廷终不改，西山寇盗莫相侵。",
        "可怜后主还祠庙，日暮聊为《梁父吟》。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-25bcd387157d76c9",
      "title": "黄鹤楼",
      "author": "崔颢",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "昔人已乘黄鹤去，此地空余黄鹤楼。",
        "黄鹤一去不复返，白云千载空悠悠。",
        "晴川历历汉阳树，芳草萋萋鹦鹉洲。",
        "日暮乡关何处是？烟波江上使人愁。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-25df59d7715bd734",
      "title": "山房春事",
      "author": "岑参",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "梁园日暮乱飞鸦，极目箫条三两家。",
        "庭树不知人去尽，春来还发旧时花。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-2619060d62ce18bb",
      "title": "送黎拾遗",
      "author": "王维",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "相送临高台，川原杳何极！日暮飞鸟还，行人去不息。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-28d329972f759718",
      "title": "游子吟",
      "author": "孟郊",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "慈母手中线，游子身上衣。",
        "临行密密缝，意恐迟迟归。",
        "谁言寸草心，报得三春晖。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-2caea89a4d16bbc5",
      "title": "塞下曲",
      "author": "王昌龄",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "饮马渡秋水，水寒风似刀。",
        "平沙日未没，黯黯见临洮。",
        "昔日长城战，咸言意气高。",
        "黄尘足今古，白骨乱蓬蒿。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-2dbacaccb1303920",
      "title": "水宿闻雁",
      "author": "李益",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "早雁忽为双，惊秋风水凉。",
        "夜长人自起，星月满空江。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-2f6aec4df83b5763",
      "title": "夜泊牛渚怀古",
      "author": "李白",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "牛渚西江夜，青天无片云。",
        "登舟望秋月，空忆谢将军。",
        "余亦能高咏，斯人不可闻。",
        "明朝挂帆席，枫叶落纷纷。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-3019e600a166cef1",
      "title": "送别",
      "author": "王维",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "山中相送罢，日暮掩柴扉。",
        "春草明年绿，王孙归不归？。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-3295f6a54ad856c2",
      "title": "九月九日忆山东兄弟",
      "author": "王维",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "独在异乡为异客，每逢佳节倍思亲。",
        "遥知兄弟登高处，遍插茱萸少一人。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-32dde54e0197dc5c",
      "title": "送元二使安西",
      "author": "王维",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "渭城朝雨浥轻尘，客舍青青柳色新。",
        "劝君更尽一杯酒，西出阳关无故人。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-33d2f50feeda51a2",
      "title": "登高",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "风急天高猿啸哀，渚清沙白鸟飞回。",
        "无边落木萧萧下，不尽长江滚滚来。",
        "万里悲秋常作客，百年多病独登台。",
        "艰难苦恨繁霜鬓，潦倒新停浊酒杯。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-376960d2d6708c5e",
      "title": "听筝",
      "author": "李端",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "鸣筝金粟柱，素手玉房前。",
        "欲得周郎顾，时时误拂弦。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-388ab66fe1874469",
      "title": "江南逢李龟年",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "岐王宅里寻常见，崔九堂前几度闻。",
        "正是江南好风景，落花时节又逢君。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-3d7bfc51ecb13fbc",
      "title": "旅夜书怀",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "细草微风岸，危樯独夜舟。",
        "星垂平野阔，月涌大江流。",
        "名岂文章著，官应老病休。",
        "飘飘何所似，天地一沙鸥。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-3ee6dfe82f2ce259",
      "title": "秋日登吴公台上寺远眺",
      "author": "刘长卿",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "古台摇落后，秋入望乡心。",
        "野寺来人少，云峰隔水深。",
        "夕阳依旧垒，寒磬满空林。",
        "惆怅南朝事，长江独至今。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-3ee8e29d08b83220",
      "title": "送李中丞归汉阳别业",
      "author": "刘长卿",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "流落征南将，曾驱十万师。",
        "罢归无旧业，老去恋明时。",
        "独立三边静，轻生一剑知。",
        "茫茫江汉上，日暮欲何之。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-3f70f02a96a4ca24",
      "title": "月夜",
      "author": "刘方平",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "更深月色半人家，北斗阑干南斗斜。",
        "今夜偏知春气暖，虫声新透绿窗纱。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-3fcd52c886d52a64",
      "title": "碛中作",
      "author": "岑参",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "走马西来欲到天，辞家见月两回圆。",
        "今夜未知何处宿，平沙万里绝人烟。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-40a61c553d268e77",
      "title": "别董大",
      "author": "高适",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "千里黄云白日曛，北风吹雁雪纷纷。",
        "莫愁前路无知己，天下谁人不识君？。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-46a1cd402206f14b",
      "title": "古筑城曲（二首）",
      "author": "元稹",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "筑城须努力，城高遮得贼。",
        "但恐贼路多，有城遮不得。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-47b2f046cf57ab73",
      "title": "宫词",
      "author": "顾况",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "玉楼天半起笙歌，风送宫嫔笑语和。",
        "月殿影开闻夜漏，水精帘卷近秋河。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-49514f33388d308a",
      "title": "留卢秦卿",
      "author": "司空曙",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "知有前期在，难分此夜中。",
        "无将故人酒，不及石尤风。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-4aa1cbb491ad41f1",
      "title": "寻陆鸿渐不遇",
      "author": "皎然",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "移家虽带郭，野径入桑麻。",
        "近种篱边菊，秋来未著花。",
        "扣门无犬吠，欲去问西家。",
        "报道山中去，归时每日斜。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-4b0a866b0ba4ccce",
      "title": "早寒有怀",
      "author": "孟浩然",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "木落雁南度，北风江上寒。",
        "我家襄水曲，遥隔楚云端。",
        "乡泪客中尽，孤帆天际看。",
        "迷津欲有问，平海夕漫漫。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-4b27c72f36f84fd4",
      "title": "行宫",
      "author": "元稹",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "寥落古行宫，宫花寂寞红。",
        "白头宫女在，闲坐说玄宗。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-4d00efa0468629d0",
      "title": "锦瑟",
      "author": "李商隐",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "锦瑟无端五十弦，一弦一柱思华年。",
        "庄生晓梦迷蝴蝶，望帝春心托杜鹃。",
        "沧海月明珠有泪，蓝田日暖玉生烟。",
        "此情可待成追忆，只是当时已惘然。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-4e4f0b97c274573c",
      "title": "登幽州台歌",
      "author": "陈子昂",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "前不见古人，后不见来者。",
        "念天地之悠悠，独怆然而涕下！。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-4f16421cc94037ed",
      "title": "暖川",
      "author": "李益",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "胡风冻合鸊鹈泉，牛马千群逐暖川。",
        "塞外征行无尽日，年年移帐雪中天。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-5021ca78ce638d2e",
      "title": "渔翁",
      "author": "柳宗元",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "渔翁夜傍西岩宿，晓汲清湘燃楚竹。",
        "烟销日出不见人，欸乃一声山水绿。",
        "回看天际下中流，岩上无心云相逐。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-5547f7b47cc54dfa",
      "title": "酬李甫见赠",
      "author": "元稹",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "杜甫天才颇绝伦，每寻诗卷似情亲。",
        "怜渠直道当时语，不着心源傍古人。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-5bc3ae3654186d18",
      "title": "客至",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "舍南舍北皆春水，但见群鸥日日来。",
        "花径不曾缘客扫，蓬门今始为君开。",
        "盘飧市远无兼味，樽酒家贫只旧醅。",
        "肯与邻翁相对饮，隔篱呼取尽馀杯。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-5d86cb6b607dab24",
      "title": "初发杨子寄元大校书",
      "author": "韦应物",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "凄凄去亲爱，泛泛入烟雾。",
        "归棹洛阳人，残钟广陵树。",
        "今朝此为别，何处还相遇。",
        "世事波上舟，沿洄安得住？。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-5d8c55959a725ed4",
      "title": "石上藤",
      "author": "顾况",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "空山无鸟迹，何物如人意。",
        "委曲结绳文，离披草书字。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-5f4caf4c98978f8f",
      "title": "出塞",
      "author": "王昌龄",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "秦时明月汉时关，万里长征人未还。",
        "但使龙城飞将在，不教胡马度阴山。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-5fba62f1e1bfc673",
      "title": "八阵图",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "功盖三分国，名成八阵图。",
        "江流石不转，遗恨失吞吴。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-614b5941804e2df6",
      "title": "晓发",
      "author": "贺知章",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "故乡杳无际，江皋闻曙钟。",
        "始见沙上鸟，犹埋云外峰。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-61d9a9a2df9a8cee",
      "title": "秋晚宿破山寺",
      "author": "皎然",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "秋风落叶满空山，古寺残灯石壁间。",
        "昔日经行人尽去，寒云夜夜自飞还。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-641ea59ca8cd7731",
      "title": "野望",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "西山白雪三城戍，南浦清江万里桥。",
        "海内风尘诸弟隔，天涯涕泪一身遥。",
        "惟将迟暮供多病，未有涓埃答圣朝。",
        "跨马出郊时极目，不堪人事日萧条。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-654bb3e7842b056c",
      "title": "逢雪宿鞭蓉山主人",
      "author": "刘长卿",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "日暮苍山远，天寒白屋贫。",
        "柴门闻犬吠，风雪夜归人。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-669de77fa34a9958",
      "title": "闻乐天授江州司马",
      "author": "元稹",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "残灯无焰影幢幢，此夕闻君谪九江。",
        "垂死病中惊坐起，暗风吹雨入寒窗。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-684beacf4f76bf15",
      "title": "石窦泉",
      "author": "顾况",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "吹沙复喷石，曲折仍圆旋。",
        "野客漱流时，杯粘落花片。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-6a22e64f5abca551",
      "title": "卖炭翁",
      "author": "白居易",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "卖炭翁，伐薪烧炭南山中。",
        "满面尘灰烟火色，两鬓苍苍十指黑。",
        "卖炭得钱何所营，身上衣裳口中食。",
        "可怜身上衣正单，心忧炭贱愿天寒。",
        "夜来城外一尺雪，晓驾炭车辗冰辙。",
        "牛困人饥日已高，市南门外泥中歇。",
        "翩翩两骑来是谁？黄衣使者白衫儿。",
        "手把文书口称敕，回车叱牛牵向北。",
        "一车炭，千余斤，宫使驱将惜不得。",
        "半匹红纱一丈绫，系向牛头充炭值。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-6b56cda4cac95aa7",
      "title": "春宿左省",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "花隐掖垣暮，啾啾栖鸟过。",
        "星临万户动，月傍九霄多。",
        "不寝听金钥，因风想玉珂。",
        "明朝有封事，数问夜如何？。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-6bd154ecddf5c29e",
      "title": "寻南溪常道士",
      "author": "刘长卿",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "一路经行处，莓苔见屐痕。",
        "白云依静渚，芳草闭闲门。",
        "过雨看松色，随山到水源。",
        "溪花与禅意，相对亦忘言。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-6c809158de545b42",
      "title": "静夜思",
      "author": "李白",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "床前明月光，疑是地上霜。",
        "举头望明月，低头思故乡。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-7044fe9b91f37201",
      "title": "相思",
      "author": "王维",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "红豆生南国，春来发几枝？愿君多采撷，此物最相思。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-7103923e9e101a3a",
      "title": "暮秋山行（节选）",
      "author": "岑参",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "疲马卧长坂，夕阳下通津。",
        "山风吹空林，飒飒如有人。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-7d24423fd043e6fc",
      "title": "闺怨词",
      "author": "白居易",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "关山征戍远，闺阁别离难。",
        "苦战应憔悴，寒衣不要宽。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-7e06b4505e38dd03",
      "title": "芜城",
      "author": "李端",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "风吹城上树，草没城边路。",
        "城里月明时，精灵自来去。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-80a69c52f31c5d16",
      "title": "望岳",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "岱宗夫如何？齐鲁青未了。",
        "造化钟神秀，阴阳割昏晓。",
        "荡胸生层云，决眦入归鸟。",
        "会当凌绝顶，一览众山小。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-81850771ebec6a6e",
      "title": "鸟鸣涧",
      "author": "王维",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "人闲桂花落，夜静春山空。",
        "月出惊山鸟，时鸣春涧中。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-821747b0bc553f41",
      "title": "苜蓿峰寄家人",
      "author": "岑参",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "苜蓿峰边逢立春，葫芦河上泪沾巾。",
        "闺中只是空相忆，不见沙场愁杀人。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-822282e66c5e0f24",
      "title": "从军北征",
      "author": "李益",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "天山雪后海风寒，横笛偏吹《行路难》。",
        "碛里征人三十万，一时回首月中看。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-8426d5a16d535d11",
      "title": "送李端",
      "author": "卢纶",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "故关衰草遍，离别正堪悲。",
        "路出寒云外，人归暮雪时。",
        "少孤为客早，多难识君迟。",
        "掩泣空相向，风尘何所期。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-892bb34cbb0e3aec",
      "title": "江雪",
      "author": "柳宗元",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "千山鸟飞绝，万径人踪灭。",
        "孤舟蓑笠翁，独钓寒江雪。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-89bed5f2be957239",
      "title": "枫桥夜泊",
      "author": "张继",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "月落乌啼霜满天，江枫渔火对愁眠。",
        "姑苏城外寒山寺，夜半钟声到客船。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-8acffc87d2e2b0e5",
      "title": "浪淘沙",
      "author": "刘禹锡",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "九曲黄河万里沙，浪淘风簸自天涯。",
        "如今直上银河去，同到牵牛织女家。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-926d6ddd820358d4",
      "title": "别房太尉墓",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "他乡复行役，驻马别孤坟。",
        "近泪无干土，低空有断云。",
        "对棋陪谢傅，把剑觅徐君。",
        "唯见林花落，莺啼送客闻。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-93f41442c68d56bc",
      "title": "将牛何处去（二首）",
      "author": "元结",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "将牛何处去，耕彼故城东。",
        "相伴有田父，相欢惟牧童。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-94b5aa8f9d6f1072",
      "title": "长安遇冯著",
      "author": "韦应物",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "客从东方来，衣上灞陵雨。",
        "问客何为来，采山因买斧。",
        "冥冥花正开，飏飏燕新乳。",
        "昨别今已春，鬓丝生几缕。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-9882cde70fb4ac33",
      "title": "秋浦歌",
      "author": "李白",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "白发三千丈，缘愁似个长。",
        "不知明镜里，何处得秋霜？。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-9a5130e99d1a2e98",
      "title": "雁门太守行",
      "author": "李贺",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "黑云压城城欲催，甲光向日金鳞开。",
        "角声满天秋色里，塞上燕脂凝夜紫。",
        "半卷红旗临易水，霜重鼓寒声不起。",
        "报君黄金台上意，提携玉龙为君死。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-9b7d936f3081e3f6",
      "title": "江村即事",
      "author": "司空曙",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "钓罢归来不系船，江村月落正堪眠。",
        "纵然一夜风吹去，只在芦花浅水边。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-9c0746efed591796",
      "title": "子夜吴歌",
      "author": "李白",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "长安一片月，万户捣衣声。",
        "秋风吹不尽，总是玉关情。",
        "何日平胡虏，良人罢远征。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-9e7c96f3ee65b4d8",
      "title": "乌衣巷",
      "author": "刘禹锡",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "朱雀桥边野草花，乌衣巷口夕阳斜。",
        "旧时王谢堂前燕，飞入寻常百姓家。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-9f3a9491bbaed666",
      "title": "寒食",
      "author": "韩竑",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "春城无处不飞花，寒食东风御柳斜。",
        "日暮汉宫传蜡烛，轻烟散入五侯家。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-9fff1526bd54fd7a",
      "title": "滁州西涧",
      "author": "韦应物",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "独怜幽草涧边生，上有黄鹂深树鸣。",
        "春潮带雨晚来急，野渡无人舟自横。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-a0b3df39fd3988e3",
      "title": "终南望余雪",
      "author": "祖咏",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "终南阴岭秀，积雪浮云端。",
        "林表明霁色，城中增暮寒。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-a3d082611662207e",
      "title": "登岳阳楼",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "昔闻洞庭水，今上岳阳楼。",
        "吴楚东南坼，乾坤日夜浮。",
        "亲朋无一字，老病有孤舟。",
        "戎马关山北，凭轩涕泗流。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-a82657e6489dde8e",
      "title": "春词",
      "author": "刘禹锡",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "新妆宜面下朱楼，深锁春光一院愁。",
        "行到中庭数花朵，蜻蜓飞上玉搔头。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-aca39d6bece7a553",
      "title": "早发白帝城",
      "author": "李白",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "朝辞白帝彩云间，千里江陵一日还。",
        "两岸猿声啼不住，轻舟已过万重山。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-addcd5b677e0aeb8",
      "title": "黄鹤楼送孟浩然之广陵",
      "author": "李白",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "故人西辞黄鹤楼，烟花三月下扬州。",
        "孤帆远影碧空尽，惟见长江天际流。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-ae8d33688e952527",
      "title": "石头城",
      "author": "刘禹锡",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "山围故国周遭在，潮打空城寂寞回。",
        "淮水东边旧时月，夜深还过女墙来。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-b2ae2c94a074e565",
      "title": "西塞山怀古",
      "author": "刘禹锡",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "王浚楼船下益州，金陵王气黯然收。",
        "千寻铁锁沉江底，一片降幡出石头。",
        "人世几回伤往事，山形依旧枕寒流。",
        "从今四海为家日，故垒萧萧芦荻秋。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-b31ccea6e382d709",
      "title": "芙蓉楼送辛渐",
      "author": "王昌龄",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "寒雨连江夜入吴，平明送客楚江孤。",
        "洛阳亲友如相问，一片冰心在玉壶。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-b3b127d830a7b269",
      "title": "宿石涧店闻妇人哭",
      "author": "李端",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "山店门前一妇人，哀哀夜哭向秋云。",
        "自说夫因征战死，朝来逢着旧将军。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-b7245288405fe51c",
      "title": "江乡故人偶集客舍",
      "author": "戴叔伦",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "天秋月又满，城阙夜千重。",
        "还作江南会，翻疑梦里逢。",
        "风枝惊暗鹊，露草泣寒虫。",
        "羁旅长堪醉，相留畏晓钟。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-b8b9788e019810c6",
      "title": "古朗月行（节选）",
      "author": "李白",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "小时不识月，呼作白玉盘。",
        "又疑瑶台镜，飞在青云端。",
        "仙人垂两足，桂树何团团。",
        "白兔捣药成，问言与谁餐。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-b9700496f0c49c20",
      "title": "秋夜寄邱员外",
      "author": "韦应物",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "怀君属秋夜，散步咏凉天。",
        "空山松子落，幽人应未眠。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-b999521f41b1f801",
      "title": "绝句",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "两个黄鹂鸣翠柳，一行白鹭上青天。",
        "窗含西岭千秋雪，门泊东吴万里船。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-ba28984e1d0cb8cf",
      "title": "凉州曲",
      "author": "柳中庸",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "关山万里远征人，一望关山泪满巾。",
        "青海戍头空有月，黄沙碛里本无春。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-bc116124c90d15b2",
      "title": "征人怨",
      "author": "柳中庸",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "岁岁金河复玉关，朝朝马策与刀环。",
        "三春白雪归青冢，万里黄河绕黑山。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-bc1b8a956b782a2e",
      "title": "鹿柴",
      "author": "王维",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "空山不见人，但闻人语响。",
        "返影入深林，复照青苔上。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-bd380ceb38b415bb",
      "title": "逢入京使",
      "author": "岑参",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "故园东望路漫漫，双袖龙钟泪不干。",
        "马上相逢无纸笔，凭君传语报平安。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-bda9bcf476fcdfe8",
      "title": "阁夜",
      "author": "杜甫",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "岁暮阴阳催短景，天涯霜雪霁寒宵。",
        "五更鼓角声悲壮，三峡星河影动摇。",
        "野哭几家闻战伐，夷歌数处起渔樵。",
        "卧龙跃马终黄土，人事音书漫寂寥。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-c4dfbde663486196",
      "title": "塞上曲",
      "author": "王昌龄",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "蝉鸣空桑林，八月萧关道。",
        "出塞复入塞，处处共芦草。",
        "从来幽并客，皆共尘沙老。",
        "莫学游侠儿，矜夸紫骝好。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-c9b3340d092024a6",
      "title": "怨情",
      "author": "李白",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "美人卷珠帘，深坐颦蛾眉。",
        "但见泪痕湿，不知心恨谁？。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-cc6fba78596b7562",
      "title": "塞下曲",
      "author": "卢纶",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "林暗草惊风，将军夜引弓。",
        "平明寻白羽，没在石棱中。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-cdc95696f283102c",
      "title": "问刘十九",
      "author": "白居易",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "绿蚁新醅酒，红泥小火炉。",
        "晚来天欲雪，能饮一杯无？。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-cf3279b02211d606",
      "title": "早春",
      "author": "韩愈",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "天街小雨润如酥，草色遥看近却无。",
        "最是一年春好处，绝胜烟柳满皇都。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-d28bed7823989a23",
      "title": "采莲曲",
      "author": "刘方平",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "落日清江里，荆歌艳楚腰。",
        "采莲从小惯，十五即乘潮。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-d686299a64ed140a",
      "title": "云阳馆与韩绅宿别",
      "author": "司空曙",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "故人江海别，几度隔山川。",
        "乍见翻疑梦，相悲各问年。",
        "孤灯寒照雨，深竹暗浮烟。",
        "更有明朝恨，离杯惜共传。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-d6e7cc786bde040f",
      "title": "咏柳",
      "author": "贺知章",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "碧玉妆成一树高，万条垂下绿丝绦。",
        "不知细叶谁裁出，二月春风似剪刀。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-d7872b7c799ab263",
      "title": "过故人庄",
      "author": "孟浩然",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "故人具鸡黍，邀我至田家。",
        "绿树村边合，青山郭外斜。",
        "开轩面场圃，把酒话桑麻。",
        "待到重阳日，还来就菊花。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-d8c4eb3f2ed7a633",
      "title": "春雪",
      "author": "刘方平",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "飞雪带春风，徘徊乱绕空。",
        "君看似花处，偏在洛城东。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-d8d02fff96c5a474",
      "title": "登金陵凤凰台",
      "author": "李白",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "凤凰台上凤凰游，凤去台空江自流。",
        "吴宫花草埋幽径，晋代衣冠成古丘。",
        "三山半落青天外，一水中分白鹭洲。",
        "总为浮云能蔽日，长安不见使人愁。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-dd82461405fb4330",
      "title": "赋得暮雨送李曹",
      "author": "韦应物",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "楚江微雨里，建业暮钟时。",
        "漠漠帆来重，冥冥鸟去迟。",
        "海门深不见，浦树远含滋。",
        "相送情无限，沾襟比散丝。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-dd939b84fce68004",
      "title": "早梅",
      "author": "张谓",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "一权寒梅白玉条，迥临村路傍溪桥。",
        "不知近水花先发，疑是经冬雪未销。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-dfdbf05333d68db0",
      "title": "喜外弟卢纶见宿",
      "author": "司空曙",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "静夜四无邻，荒居旧业贫。",
        "雨中黄叶树，灯下白头人。",
        "以我独沉久，愧君相见频。",
        "平生自有分，况是蔡家亲。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
      "sourceLicense": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "id": "poem-e1aa588fdcd93cc5",
      "title": "易水送人",
      "author": "骆宾王",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "此地别燕丹，壮发上冲冠。",
        "昔时人已没，今日水犹寒。"
