      "author": "白居易",
      "dynasty": "唐",
      "kind": "poem",
      "paragraphs": [
        "离离原上草，一岁一枯荣。",
        "野火烧不尽，春风吹又生。"
      ],
      "sourceUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry",
